    "title": "Aggies fall into early hole against region champs",
    "text": "PARK RIVER — Park River Area’s season fizzled out Friday, as secondranked Harvey/Wells County started hot before cruising to a 50-22 win over the Aggies at A.G. Strand Field. Harvey/Wells County (7-2 overall, 7-0 Region 2) entered the game having already secured the region’s top seed for the Division A state playoffs. One wouldn’t have known that with how the [[…]](https://www.wcrecord.com/articles/aggies-fall-into-early-hole-against-region-champs/)\nYou must be a digital subscriber to access this content. Please login below or subscribe today!",
